<section class="auth-layout"><div class="auth-story"><div class="section-overline">YOUR CAMPUS, CONNECTED</div><h1>One account.<br>A world of<br><span>campus finds.</span></h1><p>For the things you make, the things you need, and the people just around the corner.</p><img src="/assets/hero-scene.svg" alt="Pasor Kita shopping bag and floating campus finds"></div><div class="surface auth-form"><h2>Make yourself at home</h2><p>Already part of the campus edit? <a href="/login">Sign in ↗</a></p><form action="/register" method="post"><%- include('../partials/csrf') %><label>Your name<input name="name" autocomplete="name" minlength="2" maxlength="80" required></label><label>University email<input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="190" placeholder="you@student.uthm.edu.my" required></label><small class="field-help">Students: @student.uthm.edu.my. Staff: @uthm.edu.my.</small><label>Password<input name="password" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" minlength="10" maxlength="72" required></label><small class="field-help">At least 10 characters. Choose something unique.</small><label>Your campus<select name="campus"><option>Parit Raja</option><option>Pagoh</option></select></label><button type="submit" class="primary-button full-width">Create my account ↗</button></form><p class="quiet-note">Registration creates a Pasor Kita account. University email ownership verification and official SSO are separate integrations.</p></div></section>
